@baseUrl = http://localhost:5100

### Kiosk identifies a scanned card (no stamp) and publishes it for the admin page
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kiosk/identify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardId": "04 AA BB CC DD 11 80",
  "terminalId": "stempeluhr-pi-01"
}

### Latest identified card (admin: assign card to employee)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nfc/events/latest?terminalId=stempeluhr-pi-01
